  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math> is strictly increasing in:"
